90afc9632b56.webp"},"provider":"streamingunity"}],"episodeMappingUncertain":false,"seasons":[],"provenance":{},"warnings":[],"externalIdsEvidence":{"wikidata":{"source":"wikidata","sourceUrl":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q5084591","wikidataId":"Q5084591","tmdbId":37556,"type":"movie","imdbId":"tt0382602","tvdbId":46138}},"externalMedia":{"tmdb":{"source":"tmdb-api","id":37556,"type":"movie","sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/37556","fetchedAt":"2026-11-06T03:52:58.526Z","originalLanguage":"en-US","title":{"value":"Charlie Brown e il racconto di Natale","language":"it-IT"},"originalTitle":"Charlie Brown's Christmas Tales","overview":{"value":"Tis the season for the cheer and charm of the Peanuts kids - and this delight special offers five segments full of unforgettable moments. Snoopy works as a bell-ringer to raise money and tries making peace with the ferocious cat next door. Linus strives to strike the right tone in his letter to Santa - and his friendship with an indecisive girl at school. Sally's idea about gift giving and the identity of Santa may be unusual - but her strange notion about how to obtain a Christmas tree surprisingly does the job. Lucy tries awfully hard to be nice...and still coax everyone around her to buy her presents. Charlie Brown and Sally wait up for Santa (a surprisingly short man), who spreads Christmas gift cheer further than they had thought. Make merry!","language":"en-US"},"releaseDate":"2002-12-08","status":"Released","rating":6.5,"ratingCount":52,"genres":["Animazione","Commedia","Famiglia","televisione film"],"countries":["United States of America"],"facts":{"Runtime":"18m"},"keywords":[],"networks":[],"socialLinks":{},"cast":[{"id":124665,"name":"Wesley Singerman","role":"Charlie Brown (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iypxTXlk2O5iwelGOYUuzcSz8TY.jpg"},{"id":124666,"name":"Serena Berman","role":"Lucy Van Pelt (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vA27VLVu8tTFE2m0BfLZrZFo2nN.jpg